              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cherylp"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is now my favorite rabbit recipe! We raise our own, so I've tried many. I was afraid I had browned it a bit long, so I cut the bake time by 20 minutes. It was SO tender! I will, however, cut back on the pepper next time to 1/2 tablespoon.",
