            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mark Jeffress"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious. I can't have sugar so I substituted home made pizza sauce for the ketchup, and eliminated the sugar. I had elephant garlic so I sliced that up. I added sliced mushrooms. I added chicken stock instead of water. I skipped the Worcestershire sauce. We raise our own rabbits, mine was just a little under 3 lbs. I cut the rabbit up into pieces before I cooked it.",
            "datePublished": "2024-11-25T20:41:30.713Z"
          },
