              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Scott Saffer"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made an excellent meal. I brined the rabbit for about 14 hours before, and substituted soy sauce for Worcestershire sauce. We cooked two wild rabbits, and it was delicious - my family really enjoyed it. The rabbit was tender and tasty.",
